Winter is the final season of the year. It's preceded by [[Fall]] and followed by [[Winter]].

Most of the Stardew Valley Expanded NPCs will attend the vanilla winter festivals - the [[Stardew:Festival of Ice|Festival of Ice]] on Winter 8, the [[Stardew:SquidFest|SquidFest]] on Winter 12 - 13, the [[Stardew:Night Market|Night Market]] on Winter 15 - 17, and the [[Stardew:Feast of the Winter Star|Feast of the Winter Star]] festival on Winter 25.

